## Voice and Tone (Sentry Skill Applied)

EvANotes should speak to its users with clarity and functionality as its primary goal. The application helps users get things done, so the language should never stand in their way.

*   **Default Tone (Plain Speech):** Use plain, direct speech for 90% of the application.
    *   *Do:* "Create task" | *Don't:* "Add a new item to your list"
    *   *Do:* "Delete project?" | *Don't:* "Are you sure you wish to delete this project?"
*   **Onboarding & Empty States (Sentry Voice):** Add a touch of empathetic personality only when the user has time to appreciate it.
    *   *Empty Inbox:* "Inbox zero. Take a deep breath, or create a task to ruin the peace."
    *   *404 Error:* "This task slipped into the void. Let's get you back to your list."
*   **Formatting:** Sentence case for buttons and labels. No exclamation marks in standard UI text.
